<GuideLayout 
  title="Winning at E-commerce: Strategies for Activewear Brands" 
  type="MARKETING"
  description="From Shopify optimization to high-converting product photography. How to sell your collection in the digital marketplace."
>
  <h2>The Digital Showroom</h2>
  <p>In 2026, your website is your most important asset. It needs to be fast, mobile-first, and highly visual.</p>
  
  <h3>Visual Storytelling</h3>
  <p>Invest in high-resolution photography and video. Show the fabric's movement, the fit on different body types, and the technical details like pockets and seams.</p>

  <h3>Social Proof</h3>
  <p>Integrate customer reviews and UGC (User Generated Content). Seeing real people wearing your gear builds trust faster than any marketing copy.</p>

  <h3>Mobile Optimization</h3>
  <p>Over 80% of activewear purchases happen on mobile. Ensure your checkout process is frictionless and supports one-click payments like Apple Pay and Google Pay.</p>
</GuideLayout>
